{"title":"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nCompute the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Remainder\" title=\"Remainder\">remainder</a> when </p><center><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/d/26d4091db88b1937ee8cbdc4f3a3ad31eda2f726.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${2007 \\choose 0} + {2007 \\choose 3} + \\cdots + {2007 \\choose 2007}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"277\" height=\"53\" /></p></center><p> is divided by 1000.\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/d/54d7d48553f4d9e7ab418118607ea324cbfddfda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda38f45a64bbd4451aedeeb4584e01d91239172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"18\" /> be the two <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Complex\">complex</a> third-roots of 1.  Then let\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c9775ae9691ec67c6e941786b6b4528f525a4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = (1 + \\omega)^{2007} + (1 + \\zeta)^{2007} + (1 + 1)^{2007} = \\sum_{i = 0}^{2007} {2007 \\choose i}(\\omega^i + \\zeta^i + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"546\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p>Now, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Multiple\" title=\"Multiple\">multiple</a> of 3, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edb5f7927f19c2c84199cf6730ad0756eccd62e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^i + \\zeta^i + 1 = 1 + 1 + 1 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"214\" height=\"18\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> is one more than a multiple of 3, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/6/2862e0cdfb7a0b742c1d8fb430e9a7ff304a8fb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^i + \\zeta^i + 1 = \\omega + \\zeta + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"217\" height=\"18\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> is two more than a multiple of 3, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/0/e3087db80a41ceebe691275558339ca0fd3db81b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^i + \\zeta^i + 1 = \\omega^2 + \\zeta^2 + 1= \\zeta + \\omega + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"331\" height=\"18\" />.  Thus\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/81327cd04889d5385accafaf96688f111ffaf195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\sum_{i = 0}^{669} 3 {2007 \\choose 3i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"134\" height=\"53\" />, which is exactly three times our desired expression.\n</p><p>We also have an alternative method for calculating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />:  we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/0148146500878d59ec682a21fc834a044a97f2f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{\\omega, \\zeta\\} = \\{-\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{\\sqrt 3}{2}i, -\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{\\sqrt 3}{2}i\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"265\" height=\"41\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/f/56f1ca704bc7c5dcc4338f56d377d0f827cf3f68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1 + \\omega, 1 + \\zeta\\} = \\{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{\\sqrt 3}{2}i, \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{\\sqrt 3}{2}i\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"299\" height=\"41\" />.  Note that these two numbers are both cube roots of -1, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b38a9daa2721d114b41e2311f150274c40ea91c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = (1 + \\omega)^{2007} + (1 + \\zeta)^{2007} + (1 + 1)^{2007} = (-1)^{669} + (-1)^{669} + 2^{2007} = 2^{2007} - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"642\" height=\"19\" />.  \n</p><p>Thus, the problem is reduced to calculating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/6/c662f03154bedc67522cc3b64b5763163057bf3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2007} - 2 \\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"19\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/b/13b71ed8ae6436ed5dd3507fc83f32391724130a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2007} \\equiv 0 \\pmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"19\" />, so we need to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/9/d19659eceb8faf23d3a2c30736b19805b6b71fc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2007} \\pmod{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"19\" /> and then use the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chinese_Remainder_Theorem\" title=\"Chinese Remainder Theorem\">Chinese Remainder Theorem</a>. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd719e1b94aa3b117e876f5957a8e61eb0193c7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phi (125) = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" />, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euler%27s_Totient_Theorem\" title=\"Euler&#39;s Totient Theorem\">Euler's Totient Theorem</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/5/075f2924eb7824e7f5b436211f55f52af0834b11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{20 \\cdot 100 + 7} \\equiv 2^7 \\equiv 3 \\pmod{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"226\" height=\"19\" />. Combining, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38caeaaf0e5bcb63d3521b7bef90bf0d8e7ebaab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2007} \\equiv 128 \\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"185\" height=\"19\" />, and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/0/0d055230aea8ae0c753b6dc54bc5ac1d9d9d1519.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3S \\equiv 128-2 \\pmod{1000} \\Rightarrow S\\equiv \\boxed{042}\\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"404\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f2273835924882459627eadc8495fab33350bdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^{n} {n \\choose k} =2^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"112\" height=\"56\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/8/7a82546acd65e6a1cc1115120e20e332c6b8283e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^{3n} {3n \\choose k} =2^{3n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"128\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/7/5a74cce78153fa98e555f75c3ae9db95ecdc6d14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^{3n} {3n \\choose 3k}=\\frac{\\sum_{k=0}^{3n} {3n \\choose k}+q(n)}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"241\" height=\"56\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/02236d6b258335c6c5a4da933d9597081c28d7ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/b/7fb816118ceb1a241340e58307f9dee8563d0944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2 \\le q(n) \\le 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"116\" height=\"20\" /> that depends on the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and will make the sum an integer.  The division by 3 comes from the fact that we're skipping 2 out of every 3 terms in the binomial.  So we divide the whole sum by 3 and we add or subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/2/02236d6b258335c6c5a4da933d9597081c28d7ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> to correct for the integer based on the modularity of the sum with 3\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fe077f01af4775e69575ec1ba211ad5b7c87aea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^{3n} {3n \\choose 3k}=\\frac{2^{3n}+q(n)}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"188\" height=\"56\" /> \n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45e3d817886b4d9dbd6bb74ad23463ed139ed68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" /> is odd, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/457eb4b9adf55d2a1ce9836138aae3c12c041632.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{odd} \\equiv (-1)^{odd}\\;(mod\\;3)\\equiv -1\\;(mod\\;3)\\equiv 2\\;(mod\\;3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"398\" height=\"22\" />, Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ddebb5195e08ec52ca79f185aff6504980a22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(n)=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" /> because we need to subract 2.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45e3d817886b4d9dbd6bb74ad23463ed139ed68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" /> is even, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e93f50e0febc7fad45afa5ed0665703807d123.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{even} \\equiv (1)^{even}\\;(mod\\;3)\\equiv 1\\;(mod\\;3)\\equiv -2\\;(mod\\;3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"399\" height=\"20\" />, Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c723528ac76cf8668d6ef73453be87816a0b5b20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(n)=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> because we need to add 2.\n</p><p>So, the equation becomes:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74f59bb1621e238999b6472959eead3d66fb0e38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^{3n} {3n \\choose 3k}=\\frac{2^{3n}+(-1)^n2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"209\" height=\"56\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/39469b12c08b70680bc12b0334521ddff535d5a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${2007 \\choose 0} + {2007 \\choose 3} + \\cdots + {2007 \\choose 2007}=\\sum_{k=0}^{3\\times 669} { 3\\times 669 \\choose 3k }=\\frac{2^{2007}+(-1)^{669}2}{3}=\\frac{2^{2007}-2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"684\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55253536b1461c9cc73b726da355072ed4d91e95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2007} \\equiv 2^7\\;(mod\\;1000)\\equiv 128\\;(mod\\;1000)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"320\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/92849d6c3342fc4ca0504eceb611a7f1cbdc8a9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2007}-2 \\equiv 128-2\\;(mod\\;1000)\\equiv 126\\;(mod\\;1000)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"394\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/7/66731b822717abad4b3145c0e42dac44d3e0d69f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{2007}-2}{3} \\equiv \\frac{126}{3}\\;(mod\\;1000)\\equiv 42\\;(mod\\;1000)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"361\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/d/26d4091db88b1937ee8cbdc4f3a3ad31eda2f726.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${2007 \\choose 0} + {2007 \\choose 3} + \\cdots + {2007 \\choose 2007}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"277\" height=\"53\" /> is divided by 1000 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/9/1f9beb418ced44e0d1f4907f137f4487186e9136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{042}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Tomas Diaz. orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p><p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 4 2006-2007</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=125025\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018040327\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 312/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1830/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 202/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9516/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.707      1 -total\n 55.10%    7.001      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n 43.50%    5.528      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4420:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018040327 and revision id 205728. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}